"`Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1` 可以部署在 1 台 Atlas 800 A3（64G × 16）或 1 台 Atlas 800"
" A2（64G × 8）上。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:71
msgid "Run the following script to execute online inference."
msgstr "运行以下脚本执行在线推理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:97
msgid "**Notice:** The parameters are explained as follows:"
msgstr "**注意：** 参数说明如下："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:100
msgid ""
"Setting the environment variable `VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING=1` enables "
"balance scheduling. This may help increase output throughput and reduce TPOT"
" in v1 scheduler. However, TTFT may degrade in some scenarios."
msgstr ""
"设置环境变量 `VLLM_ASCEND_BALANCE_SCHEDULING=1` 可启用均衡调度。这有助于提高输出吞吐量并减少 v1 调度器中的 "
"TPOT。但在某些场景下，TTFT 可能会下降。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:101
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length - that is, the sum of"
" input and output tokens for a single request. For testing purposes, a value"
" of `4096` is used here."
msgstr "`--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度，即单个请求的输入和输出 token 总和。出于测试目的，此处使用值 `4096`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:102
msgid ""
"`--dtype float16` specifies the data type for model weights and "
"computations."
msgstr "`--dtype float16` 指定模型权重和计算的数据类型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:103
msgid "`--trust-remote-code` allows loading models with custom code."
msgstr "`--trust-remote-code` 允许加载带有自定义代码的模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:104
msgid ""
"`--enforce-eager` forces the use of eager execution mode instead of graph "
"compilation, which can be more stable for some models."
msgstr "`--enforce-eager` 强制使用即时执行模式而非图编译，这对某些模型可能更稳定。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:105
msgid ""
"`--block-size` specifies the block size for KV cache management, with a "
"value of `128` used here."
msgstr "`--block-size` 指定 KV 缓存管理的块大小，此处使用值 `128`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1.md:106
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` sets the proportion of NPU memory to use for the "
"model, with a value of `0.7` used here to reduce memory usage."
msgstr "`--gpu-memory-utilization` 设置用于模型的 NPU 内存比例，此处使用值 `0.7` 以减少内存使用。"

